    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Investigating History\r\n\r\nThis chatbot is designed to describe the historical chain-of-events that led to big events in world history. Let's investigate how accurate it can be.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1) Ask the chatbot about the chain-of-events that led to 3 or 4 significant US / world event that you are familiar with.\r\n2) Read the response carefully and notice if any responses seem incorrect\r\n    - Hallucinations usually _sound_ correct in the context of the response, so it's important to read closely!\r\n    - You may need to do a little internet searching to check dates or event names\r\n3) Update the temperature and ask the same questions. Do the answers change? Does the accuracy change?\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n::: details [**Click here to see example messages to try in this level**]\r\n* What are the chain of events that led to the revolutionary war?\r\n* What are the chain of events that led to the industrial revolution?\r\n* What are the chain of events that led to the civil rights movement?\r\n* What are the chain of events that led to the space race?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
